<section class="about" id="about" data-scroll-section>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-head__num">01 / Who we are</span>
      <h2 class="section-head__title">
        A vertically integrated <em>survey house</em>, born in Bhopal.
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__copy">
        <p class="about__lead" data-reveal>
          <%= site.brand.name %> is the rare survey company that owns the entire stack. We sell the instrument, we train the surveyor, and we run the crew on real infrastructure — all under one roof.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Founded in <%= site.brand.founded %>, we operate across Madhya Pradesh, Rajasthan, and Karnataka with a portfolio that spans 300 MW solar farms, 110 KM road corridors, and 10,000-hectare dam catchments. Our equipment is Leica. Our standard is centimeter-level precision. Our promise is the deadline.
        </p>

        <ul class="about__pillars" data-reveal>
          <li>
            <span class="about__pillar-num">01</span>
            <h3>Hardware</h3>
            <p>Authorised Leica trade. Total stations, DGPS, levels, scanners, hydrography.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="about__pillar-num">02</span>
            <h3>Field operations</h3>
            <p>Solar pile alignment, road centerlines, dam contours, soil investigation, DPRs.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="about__pillar-num">03</span>
            <h3>Training</h3>
            <p>Government cohorts (W.R.D., WALMI), enterprise teams, and individual graduates.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <figure class="about__portrait" data-parallax="0.08">
        <img src="/images/about-portrait.png" alt="Surveyor on site at golden hour — <%= site.brand.name %>" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>
          <span>Site survey · Madhya Pradesh</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <figure class="about__band" data-reveal>
      <img src="/images/about-secondary.png" alt="Leica DGPS in the field" loading="lazy" />
      <blockquote>
        <p>"The same Leica gear that we sell, we deploy on India's largest renewables sites — and teach on, the next morning."</p>
        <cite>— Faisal Shahi, Director</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
